  "notes": "RIVALS is a fast competitive shooter where you fight other players in 1v1 up to 5v5 duels. Each round you bring a loadout of a primary weapon, a secondary, a melee and a utility item like a grenade, and the first team to win enough rounds takes the match. You start with basic weapons and unlock new ones with Keys as you play.\n\nCodes in RIVALS mostly give Keys, which unlock new weapons for your loadout, plus Community Wraps, charms, emotes and event items. Keys are the best reward early on because each new weapon opens up a different way to play. The developers drop a new FREE code with a number on it every so often, plus codes for events, community contests and Roblox awards, and they post them on X and in Discord first.",
