  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Why can't I type a code into the RIVALS code box?",
      "a": "You have to verify first. Join the Nosniy Games Roblox group, follow the developers on X, and enter your username in the Rewards menu before the code box unlocks."
    },
    {
      "q": "What should I spend RIVALS Keys on?",
      "a": "Use them to unlock a new weapon that fits how you play, like a sniper or shotgun. More weapons give you more loadout options than any cosmetic would."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the FREE number codes in RIVALS all different?",
      "a": "Yes. Each numbered code like FREE198 or FREE199 is its own code, and each one gives 3 Keys once per account, so redeem every one that still works."
    }
  ],
